#: src/telephony/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:222
msgid ""
"When the modem stops responding, the phone quietly runs the recovery steps "
"by itself: phone service restart, radio restart, modem power cycle, firmware "
"restart and re-enabling a disabled radio. The phone is never rebooted "
"automatically. If nothing helps you are asked to reboot. When this is off, "
"the Modem Recovery window opens instead so you can run the steps yourself."
msgstr ""
"Nalika modem mandheg nanggapi, telpon kanthi meneng nglakokake dhewe langkah-"
"langkah pamulihan: wiwiti maneh layanan telpon, wiwiti maneh radio, siklus "
"daya modem, wiwiti maneh firmware lan aktifake maneh radio sing dipateni. "
"Telpon ora tau diwiwiti maneh kanthi otomatis. Yen ora ana sing mbantu, "
"sampeyan dijaluk miwiti maneh telpon. Yen iki dipateni, jendhela Pamulihan "
"Modem bakal dibukak minangka gantine supaya sampeyan bisa nglakokake langkah-"
"langkah kasebut dhewe."

